{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:14 2026-11-11 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:14 2026-11-11 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:14 2026-11-11 HKT</p><img alt=\"「驕陽雄心」在港第四捷\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/388641759457ce0e4e592ac6232fcda2/2026-11/r7_2.jpg\"/><p>今晚快活谷第七場三班千二米，此程已取得三捷的沈廄「驕陽雄心」，今仗在周俊樂策騎下取得在港第四捷。</p><p>賽後練馬師沈集成說:「『驕陽雄心』以跑馬地百萬挑戰賽為目標，馬兒在進步之中，陣上多次能夠跑出好成績，希望能夠繼續爭取頭馬，」</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T14:39:37.970263+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T14:14:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T16:14:43.403518+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T14:33:08.098153+00:00","content_hash":"d87d9871cc7d87365b1d2cbbd3c525853c584cfdcd8bdb708f100e606fed9401","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}